  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GGGI Green Rehabilitation Investment Project for Karakalpakstan Republic to address impacts of the Aral Sea Crisis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aral Sea Development Program is adapted and enacted by Karakalpakstan, Dehqon and private farmers have increased resilience to climate and Aral Sea disaster risks, Local entrepreneurs of Karakalpakstan are equipped with climate resilient agri-business models, Successful climate resilient agri MSMEs and farmers across Karakalpakstan have improved access to finance from commercial banks and government green financing.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to assist green rehabilitation of Karakalpakstan Republic to address impacts of the Aral Sea ecological crisis and establish viable measures to pursue disaster resilient sustainable livelihood for communities of the most disaster afflicted districts.&#xC0AC;&#xC5C5;&#xB300;&#xC0C1;&#xC9C0; &#xAC1C;&#xBC1C;&#xACBD;&#xB85C;&#xAC00; &#xC0DD;&#xC874;&#xAC00;&#xB2A5;&#xD558;&#xACE0; &#xC9C0;&#xC18D;&#xAC00;&#xB2A5;&#xD55C; &#xACBD;&#xC81C;&#xADA4;&#xB3C4;&#xB85C; &#xC7AC;&#xC9C4;&#xC785;, &#xC0AC;&#xC5C5;&#xB300;&#xC0C1;&#xC9C0; &#xB0B4; &#xCDE8;&#xC57D;&#xD55C; &#xACF5;&#xB3D9;&#xCCB4;&#xB4E4;&#xC774; &#xC778;&#xAC04;&#xC548;&#xBCF4; &#xC704;&#xD5D8;&#xB300;&#xC751; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9;&#xC744; &#xAC16;&#xCD94;&#xACE0; &#xC704;&#xD5D8;&#xC5D0; &#xB300;&#xC751;&#xAC00;&#xB2A5;, &#xC0AC;&#xC5C5;&#xB300;&#xC0C1;&#xC9C0; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xACBD;&#xC81C;&#xAC00; &#xC7AC;&#xB09C;&#xB300;&#xC751; &#xD68C;&#xBCF5;&#xB825; &#xBC0F; &#xB179;&#xC0C9;&#xBE44;&#xC988;&#xB2C8;&#xC2A4; &#xBAA8;&#xB378; &#xD65C;&#xC6A9;, &#xC0AC;&#xC5C5;&#xB300;&#xC0C1;&#xC9C0; &#xB0B4; &#xAE08;&#xC735;&#xC778;&#xD504;&#xB77C; &#xAC1C;&#xC120;</narrative>
  </description>
